the card graveyard now.

256
00:14:46,980 --> 00:14:48,417
But you have no monsters.

257
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:51,200
I never said anything
about using a monster.

258
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:55,660
I'll destroy him with this,
the magic card fissure.

259
00:14:56,180 --> 00:14:57,300
Adios, Batboy.

260
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:02,880
And now that you're
defenseless, I'll play this.

261
00:15:05,740 --> 00:15:06,660
Oh, no!

262
00:15:06,940 --> 00:15:09,175
Kaiba's wide open for a direct attack!

263
00:15:09,460 --> 00:15:10,820
Go, my heiress!

264
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:13,060
Attack Seto's life point!

265
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:21,360
Surrender now while you have the chance!

266
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:23,120
Don't give up, Kaiba!

267
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:25,957
Show that little green-haired
twerp who's boss!

268
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:28,580
I'll place one card face down.

269
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:31,157
You'll never get away with this, Noah.

270
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:33,497
I'd rather see my company crumble to the

271
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:36,345
ground than fall into
your grubby little hands.

272
00:15:36,540 --> 00:15:37,658
Kyber Corp is mine.

273
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:38,918
You got that, punk?

274
00:15:39,260 --> 00:15:40,480
You stole it.

275
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:43,040
I'm just taking back what belongs to me.

276
00:15:43,300 --> 00:15:44,520
Keep dreaming, kid.

277
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:45,800
Okay, then.

278
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:49,900
I think you might remember
my old friend, Vampire Lord.

279
00:15:54,860 --> 00:15:56,280
You look surprised.

280
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,485
Don't you know about vampires?

281
00:15:58,640 --> 00:15:59,857
They can't be destroyed.

282
00:15:59,940 --> 00:16:04,560
My vampire lord possesses the
power of immortality, you fool.

283
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:07,781
So when he's sent to the
graveyard, he comes back.

284
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:08,940
And there's more.

285
00:16:09,060 --> 00:16:10,280
I summon this!

286
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:13,380
Slate warrior in attack mode!

287
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,300
All right!

288
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:21,057
I never thought that I'd be rooting
for Kyber, but let's go, rich boy!

289
00:16:21,140 --> 00:16:22,360
I can't be beat.

290
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:25,700
We're in my world now, and
I make the rules. Listen,

291
00:16:25,940 --> 00:16:28,537
you may think that you
created this virtual world,

292
00:16:28,620 --> 00:16:32,160
you punk, But all you did
was rip off my system.

293
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:35,120
Now, Vampire Lord, attack!

294
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:36,580
I don't think so!

295
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:39,440
Your vampire has activated my trap card!

296
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,680
So reveal the mighty Earthshaker!

297
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:46,240
Time for me to shake things up a bit!

298
00:16:52,260 --> 00:16:55,237
Now allow me to explain
how this groundbreaking

299
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:58,217
trap card of mine works
in case you don't know.

300
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:03,320
You have two kinds of creatures on the
field, a wind monster and a dark monster.

301
00:17:03,640 --> 00:17:06,875
And one of those two monsters
is about to be destroyed.

302
00:17:07,100 --> 00:17:08,040
But which one?

303
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,100
That is up to you, Seto.

304
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:14,731
So his trap card forces me to choose
one of my own monsters to be destroyed.

305
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:17,560
If I choose wind, I lose my slate warrior.

306
00:17:17,820 --> 00:17:20,380
And if I choose dark, my vampire's gone.

307
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:21,560
Let's go.

308
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:24,480
I choose my creature of darkness.

309
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,710
Earthshaker!

310
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:29,000
Swallow his Vampire Lord!

311
00:17:33,060 --> 00:17:34,400
Why did he pick that?

312
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:38,177
Kaiba's Vampire Lord was much
stronger than his other monster.

313
00:17:38,260 --> 00:17:39,597
Yeah, but don't forget,

314
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,517
when Kaiba's Vampire is destroyed,

315
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:44,477
it comes right back to the
field in his next turn.

316
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:45,390
All right.

317
00:17:45,473 --> 00:17:48,757
Kaiba may be a pain in the butt, but
he knows how to play duel monsters.

318
00:17:48,840 --> 00:17:51,487
Now it's time to say
goodbye to your monster.

319
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:53,060
Slate warrior attack!

320
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:05,220
Now you're completely defenseless.

321
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,540
This duel is looking up.

322
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:09,160
Kaiba made a good move,

323
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:13,125
but Noah's still ahead of him by
almost 2,000 life points, Joey.

324
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:15,437
There'll be plenty of time to celebrate.

325
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:16,350
Later.

326
00:18:16,860 --> 00:18:18,640
I was thinking, Seto.

327
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:21,585
Maybe you and I just got
off on the wrong foot.

328
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:24,445
Perhaps it's time to wash
away our differences.

329
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:26,480
And this should help.

330
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:30,020
The magic card, Giant Flood.

331
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:33,300
I hope you packed a virtual swimsuit.

332
00:18:33,740 --> 00:18:34,860
What's going on?

333
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,980
Look over there, guys!

334
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:40,417
I don't know what that is,
but it doesn't look good.

335
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:41,637
I'll tell you what it is.

336
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:42,800
A tidal wave!

337
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,360
Time for your legs! Wait!

338
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:46,817
There's nowhere to go!

339
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:49,340
Time to drown out my competition.

340
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:06,820
Looks like your monster
needs a life jacket. No!

341
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:09,880
My slate warrior!

342
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,737
Flushed right out of the game, Yug.

343
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:15,880
And that's not the only
one! Look! What's happening?

344
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:19,797
Every monster in my graveyard
is getting washed away!

345
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:24,380
Now it's time for you to see
what my Deck Master can do.

346
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:26,820
But you never picked a Deck Master.

347
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:29,900
Oh, forgive me for being so rude.

348
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:32,710
Huh?

349
00:19:32,793 --> 00:19:34,020
What's Freak Boy up to now?

350
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,220
Meet my Deck Master!

351
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:40,180
Shinato's Ark!

352
00:19:42,120 --> 00:19:43,500
This is nuts.

353
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:45,664
Look at the size of that thing!

354
00:19:46,140 --> 00:19:47,100
No way!

355
00:19:47,380 --> 00:19:49,086
That boat's your Deck Master?

356
00:19:50,380 --> 00:19:52,380
That's right. Now, Seto,

357
00:19:52,600 --> 00:19:56,480
my great Ark will allow me to sail
away with everything you have,

358
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:58,900
your company and your brother!
